  "goodToKnow": "Sodann means then or thereupon, a formal or old-fashioned word, found in legal texts, minutes and literature: Sodann wurde abgestimmt. In lists of arguments, it can mean furthermore: Erstens..., sodann... In everyday speech, people say dann, danach or anschließend. Similar formal words: alsdann, hernach, sodass (so that) is different."
